Scenario: Configure alerts to monitor CPU usage and pod health. Respond to simulated issues using observability tools.

Step 1: Create Prometheus Alert Rules Create an alert rule to monitor high CPU usage:

yaml
groups:
  - name: app_alerts
    rules:
      - alert: HighCpuUsage
        expr: sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[5m])) by (pod) > 0.7
        for: 2m
        labels:
          severity: warning
        annotations:
          summary: "High CPU usage detected"
          description: "Pod {{ $labels.pod }} is consuming more than 70% CPU."
Apply the alert rules:

bash
